OL,3,AMan who attacked nun on CCTV in
OL,4,AJerusalem acquitted on grounds of
OL,5,Amental health
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Israeli court has acquitted a Jewish
OL,8,Fman who attacked a nun in Jerusalem, in
OL,9,Fan incident caught on CCTV which drew
OL,10,Fwidespread condemnation.
OL,12,FJerusalem Magistrates Court said Yona
OL,13,FSchreiber was experiencing a psychotic
OL,14,Fepisode when he pushed over and kicked
OL,15,Fthe French nun in the Old City in
OL,16,Foccupied East Jerusalem in April. It
OL,17,Fruled that he was not criminally
OL,18,Fresponsible for his actions and ordered
OL,19,Fhim to be sent to a psychiatric
OL,20,Fhospital for up to six years.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
