OL,3,AMan who attacked nun on CCTV in
OL,4,AJerusalem acquitted on grounds of
OL,5,Amental health
OL,6,
OL,7,FVideo of the attack caused outrage, and
OL,8,Fdeepened concerns after a rise in
OL,9,Fharassment of Christian clergy and
OL,10,Fpilgrims by Jewish extremists in the
OL,11,FOld City.
OL,13,FThe victim, who hit her head on a stone
OL,14,Fblock, suffered a bruised face and leg.
